(7, NULL, 'networking', 'Networking', '<p>High-performance Wi-Fi routers, wireless USB adapters, Ethernet switches, and range extenders.</p>', 'Buy Networking Devices in Pakistan | Multan Tech', 'Wi-Fi routers, LAN cables, and wireless network adapters in Pakistan. Cash on Delivery available.', 'networking devices router pakistan', 70, 0, 1),
